## Original Content
Власти Канады вводят с 8 сентября пошлины в размере 15%, 25% и 50% в отношении ряда товаров из США, говорится в заявлении министерства финансов Канады.

## Summary
Canada imposes retaliatory tariffs on US goods starting September 8, with rates of 15%, 25%, and 50% on various products. The move is a response to US tariffs. Canada's finance ministry announced the measure.

## Key Points
- Canada introduces retaliatory tariffs on US goods from September 8
- Tariff rates: 15%, 25%, and 50% on various US products
- Measure announced by Canada's Ministry of Finance


